# Elections raw sources and rebuilt outputs: ~2.9 GB of caches plus the 813 MB
# 2010 HTML mirror. Reconstructed from refs/Elections.zip -- see the runbook.
#
# Written as `data/*` rather than `data/` on purpose: git will not descend into an
# excluded directory, so a bare `data/` makes the negation below unreachable.
data/*

# ...except data/reference, which is hand-maintained INPUT, not derived output:
# the party-front table, and the geometry crosswalks whose whole value is that a
# human reviewed them. These must survive a fresh clone.
!data/reference/

